# Agent-harness worktree isolation checks the repo out inside itself. Ignoring
# these keeps them out of `git status`; it does NOT keep the SDD corpus guards
# out of them — those walk the filesystem. See the nested-checkout follow-up.
.claude/worktrees/

# ACED eval results. `run` records a hash manifest per run; these are machine-local
# measurements, not source. SKILL.md calls this directory git-ignored — this is what
# makes that true.
.agents/aced/results/
